+// MediaTek fuel gauges export time_to_full_now in an undocumented unit; the
+// framework shows that value verbatim (for example "18 days until full").
+// Report it as unsupported so BatteryStats estimates the time from observed
+// charge steps instead.
+class MediatekHealth : public Health {
+  public:
